            <formatted-text>
              <run>Based on Policy awareness, Grwp Llandrillo Menai have the highest votes for &quot;Very aware&quot; and have therefore read the policy documents for email usage. Pembrokeshire colleges participants also contribute largly to the survey and are also very aware of the policies. 
However, although Cardiff and Vale college 32 participants did not even know about the existence of policies</run>
