                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='2114' id='119' type-v2='text' w='20768' x='24481' y='25885'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true'>With respect to email policies, the awareness is comparitively low in the Middle Management department which spends the most time dealing with emails followed by Senior Management</run>
